Package: pbwatch
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Guillaume Blairon <g@yom.be>
Installed-Size: 4238
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libcairo2 (>= 1.6.0), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2), init-system-helpers (>= 1.52), bluez
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/yom/pbwatch
Description: Battery and ANC monitor for Google Pixel Buds on Linux
 pbwatch runs quietly in the background and displays a desktop notification
 whenever your Pixel Buds battery level changes or you switch ANC mode.
 .
 Supports Pixel Buds Pro 2 (2024), Pixel Buds Pro (2022), and
 Pixel Buds A-Series (2021). Configuration lives in
 ~/.config/pbwatch/config.toml.
 .
 Note: building requires Rust 1.85 or later (edition 2024). Install a
 recent toolchain via rustup if the system rustc is too old.
